{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bb32657f-a960-4eb2-b249-579b2470e4fc",
    "name": "CoLab — Connector Engine",
    "description": "Every Unified Connector Engine API (docs/CONNECTOR_ENGINE.md): accounts, mappings, jobs, calendar sync, and a signed inbound Slack event you can replay.\n\nSETUP\n1. Import docs/colab.postman_environment.json and select it. Set baseUrl INCLUDING /api (local: http://localhost:4000/api).\n2. Set colabEmail / colabPassword (local dev: probe1@colab.test / Probe@12345), run '0 · Sign in'. Accounts need an org admin (org:manage) or the platform admin role.\n3. Run the folders top to bottom — each request stores the ids the next one needs (connectorAccountId, connectorMappingId, connectorJobId).\n\nThe inbound requests under '4' sign the body with the signing secret you gave the account, exactly as Slack would.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
